app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418594938","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111773#issuecomment-3418594938","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111773","id":3418594938,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lw556","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T15:39:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T15:39:56Z","body":"> The corresponding description does not make the main font any easier to customize.\r\n\r\nI have modified it to include an example, is it any better?\r\n\r\nNote that the proposed Inter font has a [whole section in its website](https://rsms.me/inter/#features) mentioning what tags to use. Including a list at the end:\r\n<img width=\"1613\" height=\"434\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/442915a3-594d-48be-a1ae-256aa4a19a0a\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418594938/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"h